# {{hematology|cytology}} A small colorless disk-shaped particle found in the blood of [[mammal]]s, which plays an important role in the formation of [[blood clot]]s.

====Synonyms====
* [[blood platelet]]
* [[thrombocyte]]

====Derived terms====
* [[proplatelet]]

